<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3545_14141.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Mein freündtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüen</unclear>-
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aller</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glüeckhseliger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolfarth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Woledell</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestreng</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vest</unclear>, auch Ehrnveste, from fürsichdig
<lb n="4"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolweiße</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vilgeliebte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> unnd
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>.
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Denen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seie</unclear> es, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonderß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhallte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiez</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> erlitten unnd außgestandenem
<lb n="8"/>acht jährigen exilio, nunmehr mit dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">churfstl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauße</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-399" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sachßen</unclear></placeName>, <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darmbstat</unclear></placeName>, ich sambt meinm Saimbthauß der graffen
<lb n="10"/><orgName resp="#ner">vonn Ysenburg</orgName> der restitution unnd widerabtretung
<lb n="11"/>halber, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgenommen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">theills</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">graff</unclear>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrschafften</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Monaten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">albereiths</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">böß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kaysl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Maytt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rati</unclear>-
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fication</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> confirmation verglichen bin, selige auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">13</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Decembr</unclear>.</date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngsthin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">m</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kaysl</unclear>. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-559" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Reichß</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoffrath</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-15" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wien</unclear></placeName> bewilliget unnd approbiret, nunmehr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> der auß-
<lb n="16"/>ferttigung einig unnd allein beruhet, unnd allso ich unnd
<lb n="17"/>meine angewanthre brüedere unnd vetteren in daß unße-
<lb n="18"/>rigen in kürtzem wider gewißlich restituiret unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einge</unclear>-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">setzet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuwerden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unzweiffelig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhoffen</unclear>;
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> aber in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">graff</unclear>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrschafften</unclear>, die kirchen
<lb n="21"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schulen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hin</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wider</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dermaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meißtentheils</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruiniret</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> verwüstet, unnd baufellig worden daß
<lb n="23"/>selbige nottwendig reparirt werden müßen, beßer unnd
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestaldt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zugeschweigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">was</unclear>, unnd lang
<lb n="25"/>uß an dem Gottiß hauße zu bauen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubeßern</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3545_14142.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/>zwar gerne den anfang <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">machen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolte</unclear>, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frommen</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hertzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jedoch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">6</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehaerz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lang</unclear>-
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würigem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">exilio</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">da</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meinig</unclear> ich die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitt</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uber</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uberall</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genieffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">können</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgezehret</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtß</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habe</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sondern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverhoffter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würcklicher</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">restitution</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uberall</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorrath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">resi</unclear>-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">duat</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sondern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vielmehr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neüwe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußhalttung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestellet</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anfangen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müeffen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underthanen</unclear> auch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uber</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inquardirungen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unerschwencklichen</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vielfalttigen</unclear> contributionen, uff den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grundt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verderbett</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschöpfft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgemattet</unclear> worden, das wie gerne selbige auch
<lb n="38"/>woltten zue der kirchen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schulen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bauwes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbefferung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dennoch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hergeben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueschiffen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿtragen</unclear>
<lb n="40"/>können, undt ich dan glaüblich vernommen, waß maffen meine viel-
<lb n="41"/>geehrte undt geliebte Herren eben im werckh begriffen sein sollen
<lb n="42"/>eine offendtliche collect, fur aüßlendische kirchen undt kirchen-
<lb n="43"/>diener von der religion inn amblen zulaßen der Herrn dißfallß
<lb n="44"/>groffe milte, undt gütthättigkeitt, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorhin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">her</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> ohne das
<lb n="45"/>gütter maffen bekandt, notori, undt berühmet ist.
<lb n="46"/>Ersueche undt bitte also ich hiemit gantz dienundt- undt fleiffiglich
<lb n="47"/>meine vielbeliebte, undt geehrte Herrn die gerühen günstiglih
<lb n="48"/>beÿ aüßtheilttung der vorhabenden undt in amblenden collec-
<lb n="49"/>ten, der kirchen, undt schulen, in meine, meines brueders undt vette-
<lb n="50"/>rs graff: undt herrschafften <placeName resp="#ner">Yßenbürg</placeName>, <placeName resp="#ner">Büdingen</placeName>, aüch eindenckig
<lb n="51"/>zu sein, undt ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zimbliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müglich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ambts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkleck</unclear>-
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züzüeferttigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zübbewegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deros</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">part</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügönnen</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_3545_14143.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="53"/>Solches umb die Herren sambt, undt sonderß, uff alle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zudragende</unclear>
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">occassiones</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begebenheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> zu-
